UID:8188f0700cbe6d66f92e015888569b2c10292026_10:57:15_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Your Plate, Your Voice: Campus Dining Initiative Tabling
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://sbengaged.stonybrook.edu/rsvp?id=391546
DESCRIPTION:Your plate, your say! 🍽️🐺\n\nWant to see better dining options at Stony Brook? Here's your chance to make your voice heard!\n\nStop by our Campus Dining Initiative tabling, learn more about our efforts to expand dining options and improve food quality, and cast your vote to help shape the future of campus dining!\n\n🎁 Plus, we'll have FREE snacks, fun prizes, and giveaways! Stop by, grab a snack, share your thoughts, and get a chance to win some awesome prizes!\n\nYour voice matters, Seawolves! Let's make campus dining better together! ❤️\nDress Code: Casual (jeans ok)\n---\nEvent Details: https://sbengaged.stonybrook.edu/rsvp?id=391546
END:VEVENT
