UID:4653c32640e418c772aa65e5c671c60710242026_12:40:47_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Pumpkin Craze And Craft Competition !!!
LOCATION:HSC 2nd Floor Hallway, HSC 2nd Floor Hallway, Stony Brook 11790, United States
URL:https://sbengaged.stonybrook.edu/rsvp?id=391096
DESCRIPTION:Event: Pumpkin Craze And Craft Competition\n\nDate: Tuesday, November 3, 2026 🗓️\n\nTime: 2:00 PM - 4:00 PM ⏰\n\nLocation: HSC 2nd Floor Hallway 📍\n\nOrganization: HSC Student Life 🏫\n\nDescription:\n\nUnwind after Halloween 🎃 and show off your artistic skills (or just laugh! 😂) with HSC Student Life! Join us in the HSC 2nd Floor Hallway on Tuesday, November 3, 2026, from 2:00 PM to 4:00 PM for a quick pop-in tabling event designed to give you a fast mental break 🧠⚡ without slowing down your busy day between classes or clinicals. 🩺📚\n\n🌟 Interactive Table Activities\n🖌️ Pumpkin Design Challenge (Takes under 1 minute!):\n\nGrab a paper pumpkin cut-out 🎃 and a marker ✏️ to create your custom design! Turn it in with your full name ✍️ and chosen competition category written on the back.\n\n🏆 Contest Categories:\n\n🧟 Spooky- Creepy crawlies, monsters, and spooky vibes!\n\n😂 Funny & Goofy- Silly faces, memes, and unexpected expressions.\n\n🦸 Character & Pop Culture- Favorite movie, TV, or pop culture icons!\n\n✨ Elegant & Silhouette- Intricate patterns, classy outlines, and artistic silhouettes.\n\n🧸 Cute & Whimsical- Sweet, adorable, and festive seasonal creations!\n\n👻 The Spooky Share Board:\n\nWhat’s the spookiest thing you saw this Halloween season? 👁️ Grab a marker and write your story, costume sighting, or movie recommendation on our community display board!\n\n🎁 Prizes & Sweet Rewards\n🧸 Grand Prizes: One lucky winner from each of the 5 pumpkin categories will win a soft, adorable pumpkin plush! 🎃 (Winners will be notified after the event to pick up their prize at the HSC Student Life office).\n\n🍬 Participation Reward: Everyone who stops by and takes part gets free Halloween candy to fuel their afternoon! 🍫🍭\n\n✨ Just stop by, doodle, share your spooky stories, grab some candy, and connect with HSC Student Life! We can’t wait to see you there! 🙌🎉\n---\nEvent Details: https://sbengaged.stonybrook.edu/rsvp?id=391096
END:VEVENT
