DESCRIPTION:🍫☕ COZY UP WITH MEXSO! 🇲🇽✨\n\nCraving something sweet and comforting? Come see MEXSO at the Union Ballroom Lobby from 12–2 PM and enjoy a delicious Mexican classic: Chocolate Abuelita! 🍫☕\n\nPair your warm, rich Mexican hot chocolate with some tasty cookies for the perfect sweet treat! 🍪🤎\n\n💰 ONLY $4! — Chocolate Abuelita + Cookies\n\nBring your friends, warm up, and enjoy a taste of Mexico! 🇲🇽❤️\n\nStop by and grab yours! 👀✨\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://sbengaged.stonybrook.edu/rsvp?id=385963
