DESCRIPTION:Join us for a flavourful journey around the world! Explore different cultures by trying foods and snacks from various countries. Residents can unwind, socialize and meet new people, and enjoy a relaxed environemnt while discovering new flavors and reditions \n---\nEvent Details: https://sbengaged.stonybrook.edu/rsvp?id=390401
