SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Dirt and Destress
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://sbengaged.stonybrook.edu/rsvp?id=391385
DESCRIPTION:Feeling bogged down by midterms season? Step away from the screens, get your hands a little dirty, and clear your mind! Research shows that spending time with plants and nature can significantly lower stress levels and boost your focus.\n\nJoin us for a hands-on gardening break where you will get to plant and customize your own dorm-friendly indoor garden. Whether you want to grow some fresh mint for your tea or a low-maintenance succulent for your desk, we’ve got you covered. It’s the perfect way to ground yourself before hitting the books again.\n---\nEvent Details: https://sbengaged.stonybrook.edu/rsvp?id=391385
END:VEVENT
